<title>UK: KfW unit sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets 400 mln Danish crown step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE INC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON  ** 5.375     MATURITY    15.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.67    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FOR YEARS ONE TO THREE, 8.0 PERCENT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
